  "tags": [
    "Merfolk",
    "Explore",
    "+1/+1 counters",
    "Card draw"
  ],
  "strategy": "Hakbal of the Surging Soul makes every Merfolk explore at the start of each combat, so the deck goes wide early with Merfolk Mistbinder, Merrow Reejerey and Master of the Pearl Trident and grows the whole board every turn, drawing lands into play as it does. Merfolk Cave-Diver, Nicanzil, Current Conductor and Topography Tracker reward each explore, while Benthic Biomancer, Tributary Instructor and Zegana, Utopian Speaker turn the +1/+1 counters into cards and Hardened Scales, Branching Evolution and Ripples of Potential multiply them. Kumena, Tyrant of Orazca and Herald of Secret Streams slip the counters past blockers, and Wave Goodbye, Aetherize and Quandrix Command clear the way.",
  "archetype": "tribal",
  "ratings": {
    "speed": 3,
    "complexity": 3,
    "interaction": 2,
    "resilience": 3,
    "pilot": 3
  },
